cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "TamilEOT: semantic end-of-turn detection for Tamil"
message: "If you use this dataset, these models, or this method, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - alias: santhosh-005
repository-code: "https://github.com/santhosh-005/tamil-eot"
url: "https://huggingface.co/santhosh-005/smart-turn-tamil"
abstract: >-
  A semantic end-of-turn detector for Tamil, built by fine-tuning Smart Turn v3
  on 18,485 turn boundaries labelled from 116 real Tamil telephone
  conversations. Speaker labels come for free from the corpus structure — one
  audio file per speaker — so no diarization is involved. Zero-shot Smart Turn
  v3.2 scores 70.30% on the sealed test split; the fine-tunes score 83.71%
  (whisper-tiny) and 86.13% (whisper-base), shipped as int8 ONNX.
keywords:
  - end-of-turn detection
  - turn-taking
  - endpointing
  - voice agents
  - Tamil
  - Indic languages
  - speech
